  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Garantifacilitet tillsammans med NEFCO f&#xf6;r kommunala                  milj&#xf6;investeringar. Denna insats avser subventionen av garantin.      Garantin, 175 000 000 fr&#xe5;n Sidas garntiram, insats 54020155, Dnr      14/000628. Garantiavtalet med NEFCO g&#xe4;ller garantin,                  premiesubventionen ska betalas til Sidas konto hos Riksg&#xe4;lden.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Guarantee facility with NEFCO for municipal environment               infrastructure investments.This contribution is the subsidy of the    guarantee premium. The guarantee, 175 000 000 SEK from Sida&apos;s         guarantee frame, contribution 54020155, Dnr 14/00628. The agreement   with NEFCO is for the guarantee, the subsidy will be paid to Sida&apos;s   account with the Swedish National Debt office.</narrative>
  </description>
